    "title": "Pastor's sons continue annual tradition of living among Buffalo's homeless - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago BUFFALO, N.Y. — Two sons of a local pastor are taking to the streets to live with Buffalo’s homeless community. Nate and Alex Johns plan to sleep outside and in shelters, eat in soup kitchens and spend their days with people experiencing homelessness. The family carries out the effort each year to draw attention to those less fortunate during the holiday season. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 7",
